{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Choosing a durable workflow engine is mostly a question of where you want the\ndurability boundary to live. Some products give you a managed control plane.\nTanStack Workflow gives you a headless TypeScript engine and lets you choose the\nruntime, store, scheduler, and deployment target."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"That is the core positioning: durable execution for TypeScript apps without\nrequiring your application logic to move into a workflow platform. Use a managed\nworkflow product when you want that product to own execution. Use TanStack\nWorkflow when you want workflows to remain app-embedded, storage-adapter-driven,\nand portable across hosts."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This comparison shows how TanStack Workflow fits against the workflow systems\nteams commonly evaluate. It focuses on product shape and operational trade-offs,\nnot every feature or pricing detail. If you use one of these systems and see\nsomething that should be corrected, please suggest a change with notes or source\nlinks."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"capability-matrix","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Capability matrix"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Legend: ✅ first-class fit, 🟡 possible or partial fit, 🔴 not a primary fit.\nThe TanStack signal column explains whether the row is a differentiator, table\nstakes, or an area where competitors set the bar we need to meet.\nThis matrix compares product fit, not identical APIs. When public documentation\ndoes not clearly support a first-class claim, the cell is marked partial."}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Capability"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack signal"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Workflow"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cloudflare Workflows"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Temporal"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inngest"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Trigger.dev"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"AWS Step Functions"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vercel Workflow / WDK"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Headless library embedded in your app"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Differentiator"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bring your own durable store"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Differentiator"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"No required external service"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Differentiator"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Runs across Cloudflare, Railway, Netlify, Node, AWS, Vercel"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Differentiator"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔴"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Plain TypeScript workflow authoring"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Table stakes"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🟡"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Explicit durable steps"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Table stakes"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":